**Create alert rule (deprecated v8):**

```bash
POST /api/alerts
{
  "name": "High CPU Alert",
  "message": "CPU usage is high",
  "frequency": "300s",
  "handler": 1,
  "conditions": [
    {
      "type": "query",
      "query": { "model": { "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode="idle"}[5m])) * 100)" }, "params": ["A", "5m", "now"] },
      "reducer": { "type": "avg" },
      "evaluator": { "type": "gt", "params": [80] }
    }
  ]
}
